{%- assign img_url = '' -%}
{%- if section.settings.image -%}
  {%- assign img_url = section.settings.image | image_url: width: 1200 -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- assign img_url = 'ad-426.jpg' | asset_url -%}
{%- endif -%}
<section class="page-grid section-y">
  <div class="text-column">
    <img src="{{ img_url }}" alt="{{ section.settings.image_alt }}" class="mb-10 w-full rounded-[4px] border border-border object-cover" style="aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;" loading="lazy">
    <p class="eyebrow">The part nobody posts about</p>
    <h2 class="heading mt-4">Every night for a year. Sometimes twice. I told no one.</h2>
    <div class="mt-6 space-y-4">
      <p>Porn, most nights, sometimes twice. I told myself I would stop. I stopped for four days, then a boring night came and I was back.</p>
      <p>It made me tired in the morning. I was late. I felt bad about myself all day. And I told nobody, because who do you tell?</p>
      <p>Everything I found online was a man shouting at me about discipline, or a $2000 course with a timer on the page. None of it was written by someone who had been where I was.</p>
      <p>So I got help from someone who actually knows this stuff. He put together one daily tablet from simple ingredients. That is all we send. It is what our specialist recommends, in a plain box. If it does nothing for you, you get your money back.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rule-hard mt-8 pt-6">
      {% assign with_note = false %}
      {% render 'advisor-card', with_note: with_note %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Home story",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "1am photo (falls back to bundled ad-426.jpg)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "image_alt", "label": "Image alt", "default": "Photo · 1am · the night this is about" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
